IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg3-stock-issue`

-- Tests of dg3-stock-issue.l4 (sections 151 to 153, 155 to 158, 161).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the section, then written beside the assertion; none is copied from the encoding's output.
-- Arguments are positional, in the order of each rule's GIVEN.

§ `Section 151(a): the terms of a class or series`

GIVEN w IS A `Where a provision is made`
      authority IS A BOOLEAN
      outside IS A BOOLEAN
      clear IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 151(a) Terms of a class or series`
`dg3 test terms` w authority outside clear MEANS
    `s 151(a) Terms of a class or series` WITH
        `where the terms are stated` IS w
        `authority to fix the terms is expressly vested in the board by the certificate` IS authority
        `a term depends on facts ascertainable outside the instrument that states it` IS outside
        `the instrument clearly and expressly sets forth how those facts operate on the term` IS clear

-- stated in the certificate: authorised
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- stated in a board resolution under authority vested in the certificate: authorised
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in a resolution of the board of directors` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
-- a board resolution without that authority: not authorised
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in a resolution of the board of directors` FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- bylaws, or nowhere: the subsection names neither (Fork F1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in the bylaws` TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in none of these` TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- a term dependent on outside facts: the manner must be clearly and expressly set forth
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the terms of the class or series are authorised` (`dg3 test terms` `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
-- "facts" includes the occurrence of any event; whether anything else is a fact the text does not say
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that subsection` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that subsection` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the power to adjust the capital stock applies to any such class
#ASSERT `s 151(a) the power to adjust the capital stock applies to the class or series` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(a) the power to adjust the capital stock applies to the class or series` FALSE)

§ `Section 151(b): redemption`

GIVEN how IS A `s 151(b) How a redemption is triggered`
      fullVoting IS A BOOLEAN
      ric IS A BOOLEAN
      licence IS A BOOLEAN
      necessary IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 151(b) Redemption terms`
`dg3 test redemption` how fullVoting ric licence necessary MEANS
    `s 151(b) Redemption terms` WITH
        `how the redemption is triggered` IS how
        `immediately following the redemption 1 or more shares of 1 or more classes or series with full voting powers will be outstanding` IS fullVoting
        `the stock is stock of a regulated investment company registered under the Investment Company Act of 1940` IS ric
        `the corporation holds a licence or franchise from a governmental agency to conduct its business, or is a member of a national securities exchange, conditioned on holders of its stock possessing prescribed qualifications` IS licence
        `the redemption is to the extent necessary to prevent the loss of the licence, franchise or membership or to reinstate it` IS necessary

-- the general rule: full voting stock must remain outstanding
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the corporation under s 151(b)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the corporation under s 151(b)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- paragraph (1): a registered investment company, at the option of the corporation or of the holders, but not on a specified event
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the corporation under s 151(b)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the holders of the stock under s 151(b)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `upon the happening of a specified event under s 151(b)` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- paragraph (2): a licence or franchise condition, only to the extent necessary
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `upon the happening of a specified event under s 151(b)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the corporation under s 151(b)` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the stock may be made subject to redemption` (`dg3 test redemption` `at the option of the corporation under s 151(b)` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
-- the redemption terms are stated where section 151(a) allows
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the redemption price and times are stated where that subsection requires` `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 151(b) the redemption price and times are stated where that subsection requires` `in a resolution of the board of directors` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the redemption price and times are stated where that subsection requires` `in a resolution of the board of directors` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(b) the redemption price and times are stated where that subsection requires` `in the bylaws` TRUE)

§ `Section 151(c) to (e): preferences, rights on dissolution, conversion`

-- (c): preferred or special stock, terms stated where 151(a) allows
#ASSERT `s 151(c) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to dividends as stated` TRUE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 151(c) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to dividends as stated` TRUE `in a resolution of the board of directors` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(c) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to dividends as stated` FALSE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(c) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to dividends as stated` TRUE `in none of these` TRUE)
-- (c): the remaining classes may then be paid when the preference is paid or set apart and the assets are available
#ASSERT `s 151(c) a dividend on the remaining classes or series may then be paid` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(c) a dividend on the remaining classes or series may then be paid` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(c) a dividend on the remaining classes or series may then be paid` TRUE FALSE)
-- (d)
#ASSERT `s 151(d) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or distribution of assets` TRUE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(d) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or distribution of assets` FALSE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(d) the holder of the preferred or special stock is entitled to the stated rights on dissolution or distribution of assets` TRUE `in the bylaws` FALSE)
-- (e): convertible into shares of another class or series of the corporation's stock
#ASSERT `s 151(e) the stock may be made convertible or exchangeable` TRUE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(e) the stock may be made convertible or exchangeable` FALSE `in the certificate of incorporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(e) the stock may be made convertible or exchangeable` TRUE `in a resolution of the board of directors` FALSE)

§ `Section 151(f): the statement on a certificate; notice for uncertificated stock`

GIVEN multi IS A BOOLEAN
      setOut IS A BOOLEAN
      furnish IS A BOOLEAN
      other202 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 151(f) What a certificate says about class rights`
`dg3 test legend` multi setOut furnish other202 MEANS
    `s 151(f) What a certificate says about class rights` WITH
        `the corporation is authorised to issue more than 1 class of stock or more than 1 series of any class` IS multi
        `the certificate sets the rights out in full or summarises them` IS setOut
        `the certificate states that the corporation will furnish them without charge to each stockholder who so requests` IS furnish
        `section 202 provides otherwise for the matter` IS other202

#ASSERT `s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test legend` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test legend` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test legend` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test legend` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the certificate states the rights as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test legend` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 151(f) The notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock`
`dg3 test notice` a b c d MEANS
    `s 151(f) The notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock` WITH
        `the notice was given in writing or by electronic transmission` IS a
        `the notice was given within a reasonable time after the issuance or transfer` IS b
        `the notice contains the information required to be set forth or stated on certificates by section 156, 202(a), 218(a) or 364` IS c
        `the notice contains the information required by section 151 or a statement that the corporation will furnish it without charge to each stockholder who so requests` IS d

#ASSERT `s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test notice` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test notice` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test notice` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test notice` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the notice to the registered owner of uncertificated stock is as that subsection requires` (`dg3 test notice` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- identical rights of uncertificated and certificated holders unless the law expressly provides otherwise
#ASSERT `s 151(f) the holders of uncertificated stock and of certificates of the same class and series have identical rights and obligations` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(f) the holders of uncertificated stock and of certificates of the same class and series have identical rights and obligations` TRUE)

§ `Section 151(g): certificates of designations`

-- a certificate of designations is needed where the terms sit in a board resolution and not in the certificate
#ASSERT `s 151(g) a certificate of designations is required` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) a certificate of designations is required` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) a certificate of designations is required` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the requirement of a certificate of designations is met` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the requirement of a certificate of designations is met` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the requirement of a certificate of designations is met` FALSE FALSE
-- changing the number of shares of the series: resolution otherwise, now, after, class total, outstanding, certificate filed
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` TRUE 100 150 200 80 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 150 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 200 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 201 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 80 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 79 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 150 200 80 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares of the series may be changed` FALSE 100 100 200 80 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- shares taken out of the series resume the status they had before the first resolution
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares that resume the status they had before the first resolution` 100 60 EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the number of shares that resume the status they had before the first resolution` 100 150 EQUALS 0
-- eliminating the certificate of designations
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the certificate eliminates from the certificate of incorporation the matters in the certificate of designations` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate eliminates from the certificate of incorporation the matters in the certificate of designations` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate eliminates from the certificate of incorporation the matters in the certificate of designations` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate eliminates from the certificate of incorporation the matters in the certificate of designations` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- amending the terms by board resolution before any share is issued
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the board may amend the terms of the class or series by resolution` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the board may amend the terms of the class or series by resolution` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the board may amend the terms of the class or series by resolution` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the board may amend the terms of the class or series by resolution` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- the contents of the amending certificate
GIVEN noShares IS A BOOLEAN
      copy IS A BOOLEAN
      changed IS A BOOLEAN
      indicates IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 151(g) The contents of a certificate amending the terms`
`dg3 test contents` noShares copy changed indicates MEANS
    `s 151(g) The contents of a certificate amending the terms` WITH
        `it states that no shares of the class or series have been issued` IS noShares
        `it sets forth a copy of the resolution or resolutions` IS copy
        `the designation of the class or series is being changed` IS changed
        `it indicates the original designation and the new designation` IS indicates

#ASSERT `s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` (`dg3 test contents` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` (`dg3 test contents` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` (`dg3 test contents` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` (`dg3 test contents` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate has the contents that paragraphs (1) to (3) require` (`dg3 test contents` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the certificate amends the certificate of incorporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate amends the certificate of incorporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the certificate amends the certificate of incorporation` FALSE TRUE)
-- neither filing prohibits the board from adopting such resolutions later: the filings do not change the answer
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the board may subsequently adopt such resolutions` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 151(g) the board may subsequently adopt such resolutions` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 151(g) the board may subsequently adopt such resolutions` FALSE TRUE TRUE)

§ `Section 152: issuance of stock`

GIVEN cash IS A BOOLEAN
      tangible IS A BOOLEAN
      intangible IS A BOOLEAN
      benefit IS A BOOLEAN
      resolution IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 152(a) The consideration for an issue of stock`
`dg3 test consideration` cash tangible intangible benefit resolution MEANS
    `s 152(a) The consideration for an issue of stock` WITH
        `it consists of cash` IS cash
        `it consists of tangible property` IS tangible
        `it consists of intangible property` IS intangible
        `it consists of a benefit to the corporation` IS benefit
        `the numbers, times and consideration are set forth in a resolution of the board of directors` IS resolution

#ASSERT `s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` (`dg3 test consideration` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` (`dg3 test consideration` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` (`dg3 test consideration` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` (`dg3 test consideration` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(a) the board has authorised the issue of stock for the consideration` (`dg3 test consideration` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- (b) a delegating resolution fixes the number, the time period and the minimum consideration and does not let the delegate issue to itself
#ASSERT `s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue stock` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)

`dg3 test delegation` MEANS
    `s 152(b) A delegating resolution` WITH
        `the maximum number of shares that may be issued` IS 1000
        `the first day of the time period` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the last day of the time period` IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `the minimum consideration` IS 500

GIVEN already IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
      day IS A DATE
      paid IS A NUMBER
      toSelf IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 152(b) One issue under a delegating resolution`
`dg3 test one issue` already n day paid toSelf MEANS
    `s 152(b) One issue under a delegating resolution` WITH
        `the number of shares already issued under the resolution` IS already
        `the number of shares in this issue` IS n
        `the day of this issue` IS day
        `the consideration for this issue` IS paid
        `the stock is issued to the person or body that issues it` IS toSelf

-- the maximum number: 900 issued and 100 more is exactly 1000; 101 more is over
#ASSERT `s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 900 100 (YMD 2026 6 1) 500 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 900 101 (YMD 2026 6 1) 500 FALSE))
-- the time period: both edges are inside, a day outside either edge is not
#ASSERT `s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 1 1) 500 FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 12 31) 500 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2025 12 31) 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2027 1 1) 500 FALSE))
-- the minimum consideration: equal is enough, one below is not
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 1) 499 FALSE))
-- no issue to the delegate itself
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(b) the issue is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test delegation` (`dg3 test one issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 1) 500 TRUE))

-- (c) facts outside the resolution
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(c) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the limits fixed under subsection (b) may be made dependent on the delegate` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 152(c) the limits fixed under subsection (b) may be made dependent on the delegate` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(c) the limits fixed under subsection (b) may be made dependent on the delegate` TRUE TRUE)
-- (d) conclusive judgment; fully paid and nonassessable
#ASSERT `s 152(d) the judgment of the directors as to the value of the consideration is conclusive` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(d) the judgment of the directors as to the value of the consideration is conclusive` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 152(d) the stock is deemed fully paid and nonassessable` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(d) the stock is deemed fully paid and nonassessable` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(d) the stock is deemed fully paid and nonassessable` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(d) the stock is deemed fully paid and nonassessable` TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- (e) the minimum consideration against what section 153 requires
#ASSERT `s 152(e) the minimum consideration is not less than that section 153 requires` 100 (JUST 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 152(e) the minimum consideration is not less than that section 153 requires` 99 (JUST 100))
#ASSERT `s 152(e) the minimum consideration is not less than that section 153 requires` 0 NOTHING

§ `Section 153: consideration for stock`

-- 100 shares with a par value of 2 each: the consideration required is 200; shares without par value: nothing required
#ASSERT `s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` TRUE 2 100 EQUALS JUST 200
#ASSERT `s 153 the consideration required for the shares, if any` FALSE 2 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (a): par value shares: at least the aggregate par value, determined by the board or by the stockholders if the certificate so provides
#ASSERT `s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` 200 200 `the board of directors under s 152` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` 199 200 `the board of directors under s 152` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` 250 200 `the stockholders under s 153` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153(a) the shares with par value may be issued for the consideration` 250 200 `the stockholders under s 153` FALSE)
-- (b): shares without par value: any consideration, determined by the board or by the stockholders if the certificate so provides
#ASSERT `s 153(b) the shares without par value may be issued for the consideration` `the board of directors under s 152` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(b) the shares without par value may be issued for the consideration` `the stockholders under s 153` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153(b) the shares without par value may be issued for the consideration` `the stockholders under s 153` FALSE)
-- (c): treasury shares: the consideration may be below par
#ASSERT `s 153(c) the treasury shares may be disposed of in that manner` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(c) the treasury shares may be disposed of in that manner` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153(c) the treasury shares may be disposed of in that manner` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153(c) the treasury shares may be disposed of in that manner` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- (d): a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote, or the greater vote the certificate requires
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` NOTHING 51 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` NOTHING 50 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` (JUST (`at least` ((200 DIVIDED BY 3)%) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)) 67 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` (JUST (`at least` ((200 DIVIDED BY 3)%) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)) 66 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a "greater" requirement that is smaller than a majority does not displace the majority
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` (JUST (`at least` (25%) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`)) 30 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- counts that cannot be a vote are not covered
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` NOTHING 10 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 153(d) the stockholders' determination of the consideration is adopted` NOTHING 101 100 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 155: fractions of shares`

-- issues fractions / arranges disposition / cash paid / fair value as of the time / scrip issued
#ASSERT `s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` TRUE FALSE 0 100 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` FALSE TRUE 0 100 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` FALSE FALSE 100 100 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` FALSE FALSE 0 100 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` FALSE FALSE 99 100 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the corporation has dealt with fractional interests as the section requires` FALSE FALSE 0 100 FALSE)
-- the three rights of a fractional interest
#ASSERT `s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `a certificate for a fractional share under s 155` `the right to exercise voting rights under s 155` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `an uncertificated fractional share under s 155` `the right to receive dividends under s 155` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `a certificate for a fractional share under s 155` `the right to participate in the assets of the corporation in the event of liquidation under s 155` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `scrip or warrants under s 155` `the right to exercise voting rights under s 155` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 155 the holder of the fractional interest is entitled to the right` `scrip or warrants under s 155` `the right to exercise voting rights under s 155` TRUE
-- scrip that is void if not exchanged before a specified date: exchanged on the date itself is too late (Fork F4)
#ASSERT `s 155 the scrip or warrants have become void` TRUE NOTHING (YMD 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the scrip or warrants have become void` TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 6 29)) (YMD 2026 6 30))
#ASSERT `s 155 the scrip or warrants have become void` TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 6 30)) (YMD 2026 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the scrip or warrants have become void` FALSE NOTHING (YMD 2026 6 30))

-- The board may attach any of the three kinds of condition to scrip or warrants it issues in registered form in lieu of fractions; if it issues none, there is nothing to attach a condition to.
#ASSERT `s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` TRUE `that they become void if not exchanged for full shares before a specified date under s 155`
#ASSERT `s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` TRUE `that the shares for which they are exchangeable may be sold and the proceeds distributed to the holders under s 155`
#ASSERT `s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` TRUE `any other condition which the board of directors may impose under s 155`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` FALSE `any other condition which the board of directors may impose under s 155`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 155 the board may cause scrip or warrants to be issued subject to the condition` FALSE `that they become void if not exchanged for full shares before a specified date under s 155`)

§ `Section 156: partly paid shares`

#ASSERT `s 156 the total consideration and the amount paid are stated as the section requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 156 the total consideration and the amount paid are stated as the section requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 156 the total consideration and the amount paid are stated as the section requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 156 the total consideration and the amount paid are stated as the section requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- a dividend of 10 on each fully paid share; shares 30% paid get 3, fully paid get 10, nothing paid gets 0
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 100 30 EQUALS JUST 3
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 100 100 EQUALS JUST 10
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 100 0 EQUALS JUST 0
-- figures that cannot be a payment are not covered
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 100 101 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 156 the dividend on each partly paid share` 10 100 (0 MINUS 1) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 157: rights and options respecting stock`

#ASSERT `s 157(a) the corporation may create and issue the rights or options` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(a) the corporation may create and issue the rights or options` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 157(b) the rights or options are issued and their terms stated as that subsection requires` TRUE `in the certificate of incorporation`
#ASSERT `s 157(b) the rights or options are issued and their terms stated as that subsection requires` TRUE `in a resolution of the board of directors`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(b) the rights or options are issued and their terms stated as that subsection requires` TRUE `in the bylaws`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(b) the rights or options are issued and their terms stated as that subsection requires` FALSE `in the certificate of incorporation`)
#ASSERT `s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the resolution validly delegates the authority to issue rights or options` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)

`dg3 test option delegation` MEANS
    `s 157(c) A delegating resolution` WITH
        `the maximum number of shares issuable upon exercise` IS 1000
        `the first day for issuing the rights or options` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the last day for issuing the rights or options` IS YMD 2026 6 30
        `the first day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the last day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS YMD 2027 6 30
        `the minimum consideration for the rights or options, if any` IS JUST 10
        `the minimum consideration for the shares on exercise` IS 500

GIVEN already IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
      optionDay IS A DATE
      exerciseDay IS A DATE
      optionPaid IS A NUMBER
      sharesPaid IS A NUMBER
      toSelf IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 157(c) One issue of rights or options under a delegating resolution`
`dg3 test one option issue` already n optionDay exerciseDay optionPaid sharesPaid toSelf MEANS
    `s 157(c) One issue of rights or options under a delegating resolution` WITH
        `the number of shares issuable upon exercise of those already issued` IS already
        `the number of shares issuable upon exercise of this issue` IS n
        `the day the rights or options are issued` IS optionDay
        `the day the shares are to be issued on exercise` IS exerciseDay
        `the consideration for the rights or options` IS optionPaid
        `the consideration for the shares on exercise` IS sharesPaid
        `the rights or options are issued to the person or body that issues them` IS toSelf

#ASSERT `s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 900 100 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 500 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 900 101 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 7 1) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 7 1) 10 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2025 12 31) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2025 12 31) 10 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 9 500 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 499 FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` `dg3 test option delegation` (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 10 500 TRUE))
-- a delegating resolution that fixes no minimum consideration for the rights or options (the text says "if any")
#ASSERT `s 157(c) the issue of rights or options is within the delegating resolution` (`s 157(c) A delegating resolution` WITH `the maximum number of shares issuable upon exercise` IS 1000, `the first day for issuing the rights or options` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the last day for issuing the rights or options` IS YMD 2026 6 30, `the first day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS YMD 2026 1 1, `the last day for issuing the shares on exercise` IS YMD 2027 6 30, `the minimum consideration for the rights or options, if any` IS NOTHING, `the minimum consideration for the shares on exercise` IS 500) (`dg3 test one option issue` 0 10 (YMD 2026 6 30) (YMD 2027 6 30) 0 500 FALSE)
-- (d) facts outside the resolution
#ASSERT `s 157(d) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(d) the provision may be made dependent on facts ascertainable outside the resolution` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 157(d) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 157(d) the matter is a fact for the purposes of that section` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(d) the limits fixed under subsection (c) may be made dependent on the delegate` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 157(d) the limits fixed under subsection (c) may be made dependent on the delegate` FALSE TRUE
-- (e) the minimum consideration on exercise
#ASSERT `s 157(e) the minimum consideration on exercise is not less than that section 153 requires` 200 (JUST 200)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 157(e) the minimum consideration on exercise is not less than that section 153 requires` 199 (JUST 200))
#ASSERT `s 157(e) the minimum consideration on exercise is not less than that section 153 requires` 0 NOTHING

§ `Section 158: stock certificates; uncertificated shares`

-- the board resolved on uncertificated shares; the shares are represented by a certificate; the certificate has been surrendered
#ASSERT `s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 158 the shares are uncertificated shares` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 158 the holder is entitled to a certificate` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 158 the holder is entitled to a certificate` FALSE)
-- signed by, or in the name of, the corporation by any 2 authorised officers
#ASSERT NOT (`s 158 the certificate is signed as the section requires` 1)
#ASSERT `s 158 the certificate is signed as the section requires` 2
#ASSERT `s 158 the certificate is signed as the section requires` 3
-- a corporation shall not have power to issue a certificate in bearer form
#ASSERT `s 158 the corporation has power to issue the certificate` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 158 the corporation has power to issue the certificate` TRUE)

§ `Section 161: issuance of additional stock`

-- 1,000 shares authorised
#ASSERT `s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` 1000 900 100
#ASSERT NOT (`s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` 1000 900 101)
#ASSERT `s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` 1000 999 1
#ASSERT NOT (`s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` 1000 1000 0)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 161 the directors may issue or take subscriptions for the additional shares` 1000 1000 1)
